// Compile-time coverage scope of the DTP bench on VCS (`-cm_hier` with
// `-lca -cm_common_hier`, from `[coverage.vcs]` in dtp_sim_cfg.toml). Every
// name here matches an elaborated instance or generate block of the default
// configuration; VCS reports a name that matches nothing as `VCM-HFUFR` in the
// compile log.
//
// Code coverage (line, cond, fsm, tgl, branch) grades the DUT instance with
// everything it instantiates, the vendored cells included, apart from the two
// simulation-only modules removed below: the bench top, the VIP interfaces, the
// protocol checkers and the coverage modules never enter the database, except
// the bind connections described below. `+tree` on its own restricts nothing,
// so the bench tree is excluded first and the DUT re-admitted under it.
-tree tb_top
+tree tb_top.u_dut

// prim_cdc_rand_delay is the CDC jitter model that the synchronizer
// primitives (prim_flop_2sync, prim_sync3r and their siblings) instantiate
// only under SIMULATION; a synthesized DTP has none of it, so none of its
// instances is graded. A compile without SIMULATION has no such module and
// reports this line as unmatched.
-module prim_cdc_rand_delay

// dtp_j2a_state_flags is the bench observation module that tb_top binds into
// every jtag2axi bridge; a synthesized DTP has none of it, so none of its
// instances is graded. The expressions the bind connects to its ports are
// evaluated in the bridge's scope, and condition coverage grades them with the
// bridge under tb_top.sv line numbers.
-module dtp_j2a_state_flags

// Assertion coverage carries the DUT's own assertions, the `cover property`
// points of the functional-coverage modules, and the protocol checkers and
// rules under the bench top; the assertions of the UVM and AXI packages, which
// URG lists as top-level scopes of their own, stay out. uvm_pkg exists in the
// SV-UVM elaboration only, so the cocotb compile reports that line as
// unmatched. A metric section replaces the general rules for that metric, so
// the tree is stated again.
begin assert
-tree tb_top
-tree uvm_pkg
-tree axi_pkg
+tree tb_top.u_dut
+tree tb_top.u_dtp_fcov
+tree tb_top.u_dtp_jtag2axi_fcov
+tree tb_top.u_dtp_debug_tdr_fcov
+tree tb_top.u_dtp_scan_fcov
+tree tb_top.u_dtp_xtrig_fcov
+tree tb_top.u_jtag_ptap_sva
+tree tb_top.u_stap_io_host_sva
+tree tb_top.u_stap_smc_host_sva
+tree tb_top.u_stap_sep_host_sva
+tree tb_top.u_stap_extra0_host_sva
+tree tb_top.u_smc_otp_axil_sva
+tree tb_top.u_sep_otp_axil_sva
+tree tb_top.u_m_axi_sva
+tree tb_top.gen_smc_axi_atop_sva
+tree tb_top.u_xtrig_axil_sva
+tree tb_top.u_smc_otp_axil_data_sva
+tree tb_top.u_sep_otp_axil_data_sva
+tree tb_top.u_m_axi_data_sva
+tree tb_top.u_xtrig_axil_data_sva
end
